- A router maps URLs to UI and coordinates navigation: addresses, nested layouts, params/history.
- It is not a general shared-state replacement.
- Shareable filters in the URL, shared client state in a layout/context, remote data in the server cache.
- Do not add another BrowserRouter inside an already wrapped app.
