- getState reads the current tree
- dispatch sends an action into the pipeline
- subscribe registers a listener and returns an unsubscribe.
- Inside the listener take the latest state from getState
- the callback does not give a diff payload.
- replaceReducer swaps the root, useful for dynamic features/dev tooling.
- Observable interop also exists; it is rarely needed in normal UI.
- Do not mutate the returned state
- unsubscribe when the integration is destroyed.

