iq-added-redux-connect.answer:
- The connect HOC subscribes a wrapper to the store and maps the selected state/dispatch to props.
- It is valid with function components too.
- New code can prefer useSelector/useDispatch
- old connect code is not automatically wrong.
- The example needs a Provider ancestor with a compatible store.
- Select only the data needed
- if every selector returns a new object, the comparison/render frequency is affected.

